Q: Is there a way to get browser information, including version number, from a background script? A: <p>Try <code>await navigator.userAgentData.getHighEntropyValues(['fullVersionList'])</code>.</p>
<p>For eg, on Edge I get:</p>
<pre class="lang-json prettyprint-override"><code>[
    {
        &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Chromium&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: &quot;148.0.7778.168&quot;
    },
    {
        &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Microsoft Edge&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: &quot;148.0.3967.70&quot;
    },
    {
        &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Not/A)Brand&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: &quot;99.0.0.0&quot;
    }
]
</code></pre>
